      "edition": "2022 model (V3), all black: the 2019 frame (V2) in a new design.",
      "summary": "Thin-beam 100 (21.5/23/21 mm) in high-modulus graphite with Namd through the whole frame, a thickened face and a leather grip, built in small batches in Japan. Light and head-light at 312 g strung. The frame flexes and snaps back: solid, lively contact without a muted feel, a carrying ball and precise placement.",
      "construction": [
        {
          "name": "HM graphite, Namd, Black Micro Core",
          "text": "Namd runs through the whole frame; earlier Yonex frames had it only in the shaft or sleeve.",
